Repository history note
-----------------------

The first Git commit in this repository included a source snapshot from
tzlkkk/FeatDistill at commit 6feb63ef12a3bd38c8d7ade98183c5f727a0c62d:

https://github.com/tzlkkk/FeatDistill

That historical source was published under the Apache License 2.0. The current
SynthFlag inference and artifact runtime has been independently reorganized and
rewritten, while earlier Git commits remain part of the repository history.
See docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PROVENANCE.md for the audit and exact boundary.

